OL,3,GNEWSAGolf team takes aim at
OL,4,Amillion-yard challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA million yards is almost the distance
OL,7,Ffrom Land's End to John O'Groats as the
OL,8,Fcrow flies.
OL,10,FOn Friday, a team of nine
OL,11,Fself-described "extremely average"
OL,12,Fgolfers is attempting to cover that
OL,13,Fdistance in just 24 hours, hitting golf
OL,14,Fballs almost continuously to raise
OL,15,Fmoney for Prostate Cancer UK.
OL,17,FThe challenge, taking place at a golf
OL,18,Fvenue in Hinckley, will see the group
OL,19,Fuse a simulator to record every shot as
OL,20,Fthey target a world-record distance of
OL,21,Fone million yards.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
