OL,3,GNEWSAGolf team takes aim at
OL,4,Amillion-yard challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo achieve it, the team will need to
OL,7,Faverage a 200-yard shot every eight to
OL,8,F10 seconds for an entire day.
